\[\left( \frac{c - a}{b - a} \right)^2 - \frac{c - a}{b - a} + 1 = 0.\]This simplifies to
\[a^2 + b^2 + c^2 = ab + ac + bc.\]Then
\[(a + b + c)^2 = a^2 + b^2 + c^2 + 2ab + 2ac + 2bc = 3(ab + ac + bc).\]Hence,
\[|ab + ac + bc| = \frac{|a + b + c|^2}{3} = \frac{36^2}{3} = \boxed{432}.\]

